---
title: POST /bookings — SDD 7.1 in one transaction
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student (PWA)
  participant G as JWT guard + throttler
  participant C as BookingsController
  participant B as BookingsService
  participant P as PostgreSQL
  participant E as OccupancyEvents
  participant Q as Redis (SSE + BullMQ)

  S->>G: POST /api/v1/bookings {resource_id, start: 18:00}
  G->>G: verify JWT, reload user, 10 bookings/min
  G->>C: validated BookingCreateDto
  C->>B: create(user, dto)
  B->>B: find slot on the grid (18:00–19:00)<br/>else 422 INVALID_SLOT / OUTSIDE_OPENING_HOURS
  B->>P: BEGIN
  B->>P: SELECT … FROM users FOR NO KEY UPDATE
  B->>P: read settings, monthly_quota, active bookings
  B->>B: checkBookingRules: suspended? window? external access?<br/>quota? active limit? → 403 / 422
  B->>P: INSERT INTO occupancy (period = [18:00, 19:00))
  alt no overlap
    P-->>B: row id
    B->>P: monthly_quota.used + 1
    B->>P: COMMIT
    B->>E: bookingCreated
    E->>Q: SSE slot-changed "occupied"
    E->>Q: jobs: confirmation, reminders −24 h / −1 h, no-show check
    B-->>S: 201 Booking + qr_token + "Gata! Te așteptăm joi la 18:00…"
  else another request committed first
    P-->>B: 23P01 no_overlap (or 40P01 deadlock → retry)
    B->>P: ROLLBACK
    B-->>S: 409 SLOT_TAKEN + waitlist_offer
  end
